DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260731
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260801
SUMMARY:Alpha Capricornids meteor shower maximum
CATEGORIES:METEOR
DESCRIPTION:Sichtbarkeit: Visible from Europe after midnight\, low in the south\n\nPeak of a shower active roughly from 2026-07-07 to 2026-08-15\; slower meteors can produce bright fireballs.
X-PLANETENUHR-VISIBILITY:Visible from Europe after midnight\, low in the south
END:VEVENT
